<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to announce grains, oilseed crop on Wed.</title>
<headline>Brazil to announce grains, oilseed crop on Wed.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Agriculture Minister Arlindo Porto will announce the government's estimates of the 1996/97 grain and oilseed crops on Wednesday, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman said the estimates from the ministry's Agricultural Supply Company (CONAB) would likely be revealed at about 1600 local/1800 GMT.</p>
<p>This is CONAB's first projection for the next harvest.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
